        "notes": "Starting is fairly simple. Focus on taking Weapon Power and Attack Speed to boost your healing output early game. Your third item is up to you. I, personally, take Armored Vest since it helps with survivability and no one is going to have Codebreaker first round. You could also take First Aid Kit instead to help your health regen if you prefer shields.\n\nWith Threads of Fate, you can switch between healing and damage boosting faster and more efficiently. I always start with this perk so I can jump between my team pretty easily plus it doesn't hurt to be able to heal two targets even at decreased efficiency.",
