        "created_at": "2025-07-28T07:12:34.713808+00:00",
        "notes": "Round 7 is when you should be overflowing with cash. My last perk is Renaissance since the last round is crucial to your victory and it benefits from Crepuscular Circle. If all goes well, you should be able to have your fill of Epics. Whichever you take next is mostly up to how you want to play.\n\nIf you want more Weapon Power, finally take Closer. The crits are nice too if you're a sharpshooter. If the other team is super bulky/running Sleep Ana, Volskaya Ordnance is a good one to grab for the more Attack Speed and potential Weapon Power.\n\nIn the end, you won't have max Weapon Power, and that's okay. Your Attack Speed will make up for it. Even at 50/50 on beam usage, I'm still getting an insane amount of healing. However you play is up to you so if your focus is utility and damage, this build should still be great for you to use.",
